    "intro": {
      "zh": "Space Invaders 街机框体是太东 1978 年推出的经典街机，玩家操控激光炮左右移动、逐发发射，击退下压的外星人阵列，曾引发全球街机热潮，甚至让日本一度传出硬币短缺的说法。它是射击游戏的鼻祖，也是街机黄金时代的开端，是街机暗房区「射击游戏鼻祖」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Space Invaders arcade cabinet, released by Taito in 1978, let players move a laser cannon left and right to shoot down descending alien rows. It ignited a global arcade craze—legendarily causing a coin shortage in Japan—and pioneered the shooter genre and the golden age of arcades."
    },
    "era": 1978,
    "manufacturer": "Taito"
  },
